# SKID KIDS: BOOMER, the kangaroo who partners the fifth match. Three kids'
# passives in one: high quick hops, two bags in the pouch, fast feet (he
# slips like anyone: no source gives him the fast kid's grip). His special
# throw is the MARBLE BAG (it bursts into a ring of eight marbles; a kid who
# steps on one slips and lies helpless for longer, and the marble is
# spent); his move is the POUCH GRAB (two bags pulled in, one after the
# other). (2P versus: player 2 has the kangaroo.)
game skidkids
wait 5
cheat versus 0 1 12 3
cheat coach 0
cheat clearbags
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 3
cheat play
expect who2 == 12
press P2A
waituntil kz2 >= 18 20
wait 40
cheat kid 2 280 100
hold P2LEFT 30
expect kx2 <= 242
cheat puddle 250 140
cheat kid 2 280 140
hold P2LEFT 50
expect n_slip == 1
expect kst2 == 5
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
# two bags in the pouch
cheat kid 2 250 100
cheat loose 244 100
cheat loose 244 100
press P2B
wait 16
press P2B
wait 16
expect held2 == 2
# the marble bag: it stops by the kid it hits, and bursts
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 1 100 100
cheat kid 0 60 150
cheat stars 2 2
cheat give 2 1
hold P2B 70
wait 2
expect bagkind0 == 4
waituntil marbles == 8 150
expect n_boom == 1
expect score1 == 1
# a marble under foot: a long slip, and the marble is spent
cheat marble 90 150
cheat kid 0 60 150
hold RIGHT 30
expect n_slip == 2
expect kst0 == 5
expect timer0 > 120
expect marbles == 8
# the pouch grab: two bags, one after the other
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 2 280 60
cheat loose 200 160
cheat loose 250 170
cheat stars 2 2
press P2A
wait 5
press P2A
expect n_reel == 1
waituntil n_reel == 2 30
waituntil held2 == 2 60
